 đáng sợ và đàn anh nấu ăn hậu đậu hết thuốc chữa, Seong Jae liên tục tạo ra hàng loạt tình huống dở khóc dở cười.</p><p>Từ những bữa cơm quân đội tưởng chừng nhàm chán, anh dần biến căn bếp doanh trại thành nơi gắn kết tình đồng đội bằng những món ăn nóng hổi, hài hước và đầy cảm xúc.</p>","tmdb":{"type":"tv","id":"295509","season":1,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0},"modified":"2026-06-17T23:28:14.000Z","cast":["Park Ji-hoon","Yoon Kyung-ho","Han Dong-hee","Lee Hong-nae","Jung Woong-in","Lee Sang-yi","Jeon So-young","Kang Joon-kyu"],"director":["Jo Nam-hyung"],"cast_meta":[{"name":"Park Ji-hoon","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Park Ji-hoon","tmdb_id":1901640,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zbNZZ8o6qF3gaDndsq76h19Pe33.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1901640"},{"name":"Yoon Kyung-ho","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Yoon Kyung-ho","tmdb_id":560081,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/217cVZqyvJypi4OR1uvxoaJxvLm.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/560081"},{"name":"Han Dong-hee","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Han Dong-hee","tmdb_id":3684067,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/nltWyQ738gemdw2ghC4aebzGMXD.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/3684067"},{"name":"Lee Hong-nae","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Lee Hong-nae","tmdb_id":2589093,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fZTSESUAmiyl6w5GutEhwtpwxv6.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/2589093"},{"name":"Jung Woong-in","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Jung Woong-in","tmdb_id":112785,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/8chD5NkFYH5glIqBt6zyevoQRhK.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/112785"},{"name":"Lee Sang-yi","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Lee Sang-yi","tmdb_id":1863428,"profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/4OSOux7D8ZIbNsA7eINSwmHM9nb.jpg","tmdb_url":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1863428"},{"name":"Jeon So-young","name_vi":null,"name_original":"Jeon So-young","tmdb_id":4903385,"profile":"https:/